# ── WORKFLOW NOTE FOR CLAUDE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Do NOT create git commits in this repo. The maintainer handles ALL commits
# (and pushes/tags/releases) personally. Make and stage edits, but never run
# `git commit` unless explicitly told to in that message.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Generated test pages + their output — rebuild with `python3 tests/build.py`
tests/run.html
tests/run-async.html
tests/out.png
tests/results/

# Tauri desktop build
src-tauri/target/
# Regenerated by tauri-build on every compile from capabilities/ + tauri.conf.json
src-tauri/gen/
# Frontend staging dir — build.rs copies index.html/*.js/*.css here for the bundler
dist/

# Flatpak build artifacts. The ONLY sources here are com.crunchyvfx.app.yml + .metainfo.xml;
# everything else is regenerated by flatpak-builder (repo/ is an OSTree repo = ~70 binary files),
# plus the .deb build input and the built bundle. Never commit these.
flatpak/repo/
flatpak/build-dir/
flatpak/.flatpak-builder/
flatpak/*.deb
flatpak/*.flatpak
